    "en": {
      "trackName": "Brain Game for watch",
      "description": "Keep your mind sharp with an elegant and relaxing puzzle experience! With over 700 unique challenges, test your memory and cognitive skills using beautiful color gradients and minimalist patterns.\n\nWhether you want a quick mental workout or a relaxing logic game, this app is designed to improve your mental agility step by step.\n\nMain Features:\n- 700+ Mind Challenges: From memorizing sequences to solving color mix puzzles.\n- Apple Watch Ready: Train your brain anywhere, taking advantage of little moments directly from your wrist.\n- Relaxing & Minimalist: Enjoy smooth color transitions and gradients that reduce stress while you focus.\n- Boost Your Skills: Improve your mental agility, focus, and memory recall with daily practice.\n- Varied Game Modes: Play forward sequences, reverse memory, spatial recall, and mixed logic tests.\n\nChallenge your brain daily and see how far your memory can go!",
